<title>USA: Unifrax issues $100 million debt due 2003.</title>
<headline>Unifrax issues $100 million debt due 2003.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following high-yield debt issue from Unifrax Corp was priced on Friday, according to a high-yield market source.</p>
<p>BT Securities Corp is lead manager on the deal.</p>
<p>BORROWER UNIFRAX CORP</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	  COUPON 10.50 PCT  MATURITY 11/01/03</p>
<p>TYPE SENIOR NOTES   ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY B2	 YIELD 10.50 PCT   PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B			   CALLABLE N.A</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
